<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Edit Customer — <%= customer.name %></title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  body { background: #f4f5f7; font-size: 14px; }
  .main { margin-left: 220px; }
  .topbar { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; }
  @media(max-width:768px){ .main{ margin-left:60px; } }

  .wrap{ max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; }

  .ledger-card .card-head{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  }
  .avatar-mark{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:#0d6efd; color:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700;
    font-size:16px; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .card-head .name{ font-size:16px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.1; }
  .card-head .sub{ font-size:11px; color:#6c757d; letter-spacing:.3px; }

  .section-title{
    font-size:10px; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700;
    color:#6c757d; margin-bottom:14px; margin-top:26px;
  }
  .section-title:first-child{ margin-top:0; }

  .field-group{ margin-bottom:18px; }
  .field-group label{
    display:block; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px;
    color:#6c757d; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .field-group .req{ color:#dc3545; }

  .form-row{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; }
  @media(max-width:560px){ .form-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  .form-actions{
    display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:8px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid #e2e4e9;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>

<main class="main">

  <div class="topbar bg-white border-bottom px-4 py-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between shadow-sm">
    <h2 class="fs-6 fw-semibold mb-0">✏️ Edit Customer</h2>
    <a href="/customers/<%= customer._id %>" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">← Back to Ledger</a>
  </div>

  <div class="p-4">
    <div class="wrap">

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-danger border-start border-danger border-4">❌ <%= error %></div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="ledger-card card shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-header bg-light py-3 card-head">
          <div class="avatar-mark"><%= customer.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
          <div>
            <div class="name"><%= customer.name %></div>
            <div class="sub">Editing customer details</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <form action="/customers/<%= customer._id %>?_method=PUT" method="POST">

            <div class="section-title">Basic Info</div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>Full Name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" name="name" class="form-control" value="<%= customer.name %>" required placeholder="Customer ka naam">
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="field-group">
                <label>Phone Number</label>
                <input type="tel" name="phone" class="form-control" value="<%= customer.phone || '' %>" placeholder="03xx-xxxxxxx">
              </div>
              <div class="field-group">
                <label>Email</label>
                <input type="email" name="email" class="form-control" value="<%= customer.email || '' %>" placeholder="email@example.com">
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">Additional Details</div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>Address</label>
              <textarea name="address" class="form-control" rows="2" placeholder="Ghar ya dukaan ka address..."><%= customer.address || '' %></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>Notes</label>
              <input type="text" name="notes" class="form-control" value="<%= customer.notes || '' %>" placeholder="Koi khaas baat...">
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">💳 Credit / Advance</div>
            <div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 px-3 mb-3">
              ⚠️ Yeh live sales se calculate hota hai — yahan change karoge to sirf ek "adjustment" save hoga
              (asal invoices nahi badlengi), aur yeh number har jagah (naya sale dropdown, credit-sales page,
              ledger) turant reflect hoga.
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="field-group">
                <label>🔴 Credit (customer ne dena hai)</label>
                <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="credit" class="form-control" value="<%= currentCredit || 0 %>">
              </div>
              <div class="field-group">
                <label>💰 Advance (customer ka wallet)</label>
                <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="advance" class="form-control" value="<%= customer.walletBalance || 0 %>">
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-actions">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">💾 Save Changes</button>
              <a href="/customers/<%= customer._id %>" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">Cancel</a>
            </div>

          </form>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
